  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bio-capsules and AI solutions to improve Vietnamese livestock industry productivity(Seed1/2024-2026/300million)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Development of a cost-effective bio-capsule prototype for Vietnam, including local AI algorithm development and obtaining KC certification and patents. 2. Deployment of the cost-effective bio-capsule in Vietnam through building partnerships with local partners, installing LiveCare solution gateways, supplying bio-capsules, and setting up at farms. 3. Provision of education on the LiveCare solution, planning educational courses for farmers, and conducting training for end-users (direct beneficiaries).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDG 2.3 Through technological upgrades and innovation, we aim to enhance the productivity of the livestock industry and increase the income of livestock farmers.&#xACF5;&#xD0DC;&#xC728;* 30% &#xC774;&#xC0C1; &#xAC10;&#xC18C;&#xB85C; &#xC778;&#xD55C; &#xC0DD;&#xC0B0;&#xC131; &#xC99D;&#xB300;, &#xC18C;&#xC758; &#xD3D0;&#xC0AC;&#xC728;** 50% &#xC774;&#xC0C1; &#xAC10;&#xC18C;&#xB97C; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xC18C;&#xB4DD;&#xD558;&#xB77D; &#xBC29;&#xC9C0;&#xB97C; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xB18D;&#xAC00;&#xC18C;&#xB4DD;&#xC99D;&#xB300;</narrative>
  </description>
